Title: SyncClip – A Cross-Platform Online Clipboard Application Using Flutter

In everyday computing, sharing text, links, and code snippets between different devices—such as a smartphone and a laptop—often requires sending messages to oneself via chat apps or drafting emails.
SyncClip is a simple, lightweight online clipboard application developed using the Flutter framework and Dart. 
The application allows users to create temporary text rooms where content typed or pasted on one device is updated and accessible on other connected devices.
The project focuses on clean user interface design, integration with native device clipboards for quick copy-paste operations, and basic real-time data handling.
SyncClip provides a functional, cross-platform solution to daily text-sharing needs while demonstrating the core concepts of state management, UI widgets, and network communication in Flutter.
